{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"GHSA-x33c-w48q-qrgc","published":"2026-11-10T23:06:32Z","modified":"2026-11-10T23:15:18.341686605Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-114149"],"summary":"Microsoft Security Advisory CVE-2026-114149 - ASP.NET Core Denial of Service Vulnerability","details":"## Executive summary\n\nMicrosoft is releasing this security advisory to provide information about a vulnerability in ASP.NET Core. This advisory provides guidance on updating affected applications and components.\n\nMultipart form processing can bypass the configured header-count limit and consume excessive resources.\n\n## Announcement\n\nAnnouncement for this issue can be found at https://github.com/dotnet/announcements/issues/511\n\n## CVSS Details\n\n- **Version:** 3.1\n- **Severity:** High\n- **Score:** 7.5 (base score)\n- **Vector:** `CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H/E:U/RL:O/RC:C`\n- **Weakness:** CWE-770\n\n## Affected Platforms\n\n- **Platforms:** Windows, Linux, macOS\n- **Architectures:** All\n\n## <a name=\"affected-packages\"></a>Affected Packages\n\nThe tables list affected version ranges and fixed package versions. Runtime and standalone deliveries are listed separately.\n\n### .NET 8.0 - affected runtime packages\n\nPackage | Affected version | Patched version\n--- | --- | ---\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm) | >= 8.0.0-preview.1.23112.2, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm64) | >= 8.0.0-preview.1.23112.2, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm) | >= 8.0.0-preview.1.23112.2, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm64) | >= 8.0.0-preview.1.23112.2, <= 8.0.33 | 8.